silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_concrete_anchor_4#domesticcattypeseed silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCatTypeSeed is The type-seed node: 'DomesticCat' as the species-level type predicate for Mittens. The required factorization of k1 routes through TypeSeed — the taxonomy row justifies the type seed, the type seed enters D_Mittens." .
